silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_09_proofs_and_uniqueness_sections_02_cocone_uniqueness_proofs_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "CoconeUniquenessProofsYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_09_proofs_and_uniqueness_sections_02_cocone_uniqueness_proofs_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'CoconeUniquenessProofsYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Cocone Uniqueness Proofs: Six Cases', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Cocone Uniqueness Proofs: Six Cases', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .
